Digital Footprints
Active: Posts, Comments, Likes, Shares, Uploads, Review
Passive: Browsing Activity, Website Interactions, Location Information, Cookies and Tracking, Platform Activity



5P's for a positive digital footprint
-Profile: Only use firstname, do not give out nay personal information
-Permission: Make sure you have permission to view and share information online
-Privacy: Kepp passwords and personal private details
-Positive: Make sure the information you share is positive.
